cuisine); I-BAR (Stocked with well known brands) and is the talk of town for variety and excellent menu offered. The Grand has three Banquet halls to accommodate around 30 to 600 guests. The highlight of the Hotel is ‘Board Room’, which is designed as per international standards. The Car parking of the Hotel can be rated as the best in Tirupati. \n</p>\n<br>\n         <!--           <p>\nPLR has ventured into Mining industry in the year 1996 with an objective to execute efficient and effective mining operations. The first project was awarded by state owned mining company Singerani Collaries  Company, with scope of work of Excavation of rock, transportation, dumping and  levelling with a work volume amounting to 44.57 BCM (Bank Cubic Meters). PLR has successfully achieved great mileage in executing the project and proved its abilities to many other principles. \n </p>\n                    <br />\n                    <p>\n                   Parallelly, recognizing the capabilities of executing Mining projects, APMDC has also awarded a 23.36 BCM project involving Removal of Overburden at Mangampeta Barytes Project.  \n </p> -->\n<br>\n<p>Website: <a href=\"http://www.hotelplrgrand.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.hotelplrgrand.com</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"columnpara2\" style=\"margin-left:5%;\">\n                    <p class=\"para\">\n                    Hotel grand *** is a three star hotel with 100 spacious, richly decorated rooms distributed over five floors. The Grand is the best in the temple city in terms of both accessibility and economical. The hotel is right next to the central Bus station, a walking distance from the railway station and half an hour drive from the Airport. The Travel desk has an efficient team and is ready help the guests by providing all kinds of services such as organising visits to local temples, travel bookings etc.</p><br>\n<!-- <p>PLR owns and operates state of the art HEM Machinery, this is also a factor which enables them to be in the forefront setting apart from its competitors. The company owns Surface Miners which makes them capable of extracting 10 Million tons per year.\n</p><br />\n<p>PLR believes in precision on deliverables and ensures completion of projects way before deadlines by maximum utilization of available resources. \n</p>-->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n</main>\n   <script src=\"../../maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.7/js/bootstrap.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-Tc5IQib027qvyjSMfHjOMaLkfuWVxZxUPnCJA7l2mCWNIpG9mGCD8wGNIcPD7Txa \" crossorigin=\"anonymous \"></script>\n   \n       <div class=\"footer\" style=\"margin:-1%;\">\n             <div class=\"footerdiv\">\n     \n\n\n        <div style=\"padding-top:6%;width:50%;margin-left:10%;\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n      <a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;color:#d26235;text-decoration:none;font-weight: normal;\n\t  font-size:1.17em;padding-left:2px;text-align: left;white-space:nowrap;\">ABOUT US</a>\n      <br><br><br>\n\t  <a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;\n    font-weight:300;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:white;\n    text-decoration:none;padding-left:3px;\" href=\"AboutusJV.html\">Journey &amp; Vision</a><br><br><br>\n      <a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;\n    font-weight:300;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:white;\n    text-decoration:none;padding-left:3px;\" href=\"Directors.html\">Directors</a><br><br><br>\n      <a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;\n    font-weight:300;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:white;\n    text-decoration:none;padding-left:3px;\" href=\"Achievement.html\">Achievements</a></div><br><br><br>\n\t<div class=\"col\">\n<a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;color:#d26235;font-weight: normal;font-size:1.17em;text-align: left;\">RESOURCES</a>\n<br><br><br>\n                 <a style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Roboto;\n    font-weight:300;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color: